                                    <p>Three marble plaque fragments with tekmor dedication by Omptios family, forum excavations, Antiocheia Pisidiae. Height 37 cm., width 25 cm., thickness 4 cm.</p>
                                    <material ref="https://www.eagle-network.eu/voc/material/lod/48.html">marble</material>
