                            <layoutDesc>
                                <layout>
                                    <p>Three fragments of plaque, bottom of anta on left preserved. The Omptii brothers and sisters (Gaios, Titos, Kaptiōn Neos, Paula, Mazima) with their foster children dedicate as tekmoreusantes to Men the Ancestral God.</p>
